# ============================================================
# SORAKU MONOREPO — Root Environment Variables
# ============================================================
#
# Setiap app/service punya .env.example sendiri:
#
#   apps/web/.env.example         → Web komunitas (Vercel)
#   apps/stream/.env.example      → Anime streaming (Vercel)
#   apps/mobile/.env.example      → Mobile app (Expo)
#   services/api/.env.example     → Central API (Vercel)
#   services/bot/.env.example     → Discord bot (Railway)
#   services/anime-scraper/.env.example → Anime scraper (Railway)
#   services/scheduler/.env.example     → Scheduler (Railway)
#
# Setup:
#   cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
#   cp services/api/.env.example services/api/.env.local
#   cp services/bot/.env.example services/bot/.env
#
# ⚠ JANGAN commit .env / .env.local ke Git
# ============================================================

# ── Shared across all services ────────────────────────────────
